---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";

const title = "Indonesia Tax Calculators Guide: PPh 21 Personal Tax & 11% PPN VAT";
const description = "Complete guide to Indonesia financial and tax calculators. Learn how to estimate your PPh 21 personal income tax, PTKP deductions, net salary after tax, and 11% VAT PPN.";
const baseUrl = "https://finsiva.com";
const currentUrl = `${baseUrl}/knowledge/indonesia-tax-calculators`;

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  mainEntity: [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      name: "How do I calculate PPh 21 personal income tax in Indonesia?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "Determine gross annual salary, subtract 5% occupational cost (Biaya Jabatan max IDR 6M/yr) and applicable PTKP allowance, then apply 2026 progressive rates from 5% to 35%."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      name: "How does the Indonesia VAT (PPN) calculator work?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "The VAT calculator computes 11% PPN inclusive and exclusive amounts for invoice pricing, commercial sales, and digital service imports."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={currentUrl}
  robots="index,follow"
  schema={faqSchema}
  image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c?w=1200&q=80"
  imageAlt="Calculator and tax documents"
>
  <article id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[
        { label: "Home", href: "/" },
        { label: "Knowledge Center", href: "/knowledge" },
        { label: "Indonesia Tax Calculators" }
      ]} />

      <header class="pt-8 pb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-on-primary sm:text-5xl">Indonesia Tax Calculators Guide</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-body dark:text-muted">Learn how to accurately compute personal income tax (PPh 21), PTKP deductions, net take-home salary, and 11% PPN VAT with Finsiva tools.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose max-w-none prose-headings:mt-10 prose-headings:mb-4 prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:font-semibold prose-h2:text-ink dark:prose-h2:text-on-primary prose-p:text-body prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-a:text-link prose-a:underline">
        <h2>Indonesian Financial & Tax Calculation Suite</h2>
        <p>Calculating income tax and VAT in Indonesia requires factoring in specific DJP statutory allowances such as PTKP non-taxable income limits and progressive tax tiers. Finsiva provides instant, up-to-date calculation tools tailored to Indonesian tax regulations.</p>

        <h2>Available Indonesia Tax Calculators</h2>
        <div class="my-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">1. Personal Income Tax Calculator (PPh 21)</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Computes 2026 progressive rates (5% to 35%), subtracts occupational cost and PTKP allowances, and calculates net monthly take-home salary.</p>
            <a href="/countries/indonesia/income-tax/income-tax-calculator" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-link hover:underline">Launch PPh 21 Tax Calculator →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">2. VAT Calculator (11% PPN)</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Instantly calculates 11% PPN inclusive and exclusive amounts for business invoicing, transactions, and e-Faktur compliance.</p>
            <a href="/countries/indonesia/vat/vat-calculator" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-link hover:underline">Launch VAT Calculator →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Worked PPh 21 Calculation Example</h2>
        <p>Consider a married taxpayer with 1 child (K/1 status) earning a gross annual salary of <strong>IDR 180,000,000</strong>:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Gross Income: IDR 180,000,000</li>
          <li>Occupational Cost (5%, max 6M): IDR 6,000,000</li>
          <li>Net Income before PTKP: IDR 174,000,000</li>
          <li>PTKP Allowance (K/1): IDR 63,000,000</li>
          <li><strong>Net Taxable Income:</strong> IDR 174,000,000 – IDR 63,000,000 = <strong>IDR 111,000,000</strong></li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Applying 2026 Brackets:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Tax on First IDR 60,000,000 @ 5% = IDR 3,000,000</li>
          <li>Tax on Remaining IDR 51,000,000 @ 15% = IDR 7,650,000</li>
          <li><strong>Total Annual PPh 21 Payable:</strong> IDR 10,650,000 (Effective Tax Rate: ~5.92%)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Related Guides & Resources</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/knowledge/indonesia-income-tax" class="text-link hover:underline">Indonesia Income Tax Knowledge Hub</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blogs/indonesia-income-tax-rates-brackets-2026" class="text-link hover:underline">Indonesia Income Tax Rates & Brackets 2026</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blogs/indonesia-tax-for-expats-foreigners-bali-guide" class="text-link hover:underline">Expat & Bali Tax Guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="/countries/indonesia" class="text-link hover:underline">Finsiva Indonesia Country Tax Portal</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
